<title>USA: Autauga Cty BOE, Ala. won by Sterne, Agee &amp; Leach.</title>
<headline>Autauga Cty BOE, Ala. won by Sterne, Agee &amp; Leach.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sterne, Agee &amp; Leach, Inc., said it won $1.060 million of Autauga Cty Board of Education, Ala., capital outlay school warrants (School District No. 1 Special Ad Valorem Tax), with a net interest cost of 4.790 percent.</p>
